      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## W5_07 Character sheet\n\n- **image_1** = blank turnaround layout. It is the canvas Ideogram edits, so the output keeps its size and panel layout (`size: source`).\n- **image_2** = the person. Use a full-body, front-facing photo on a plain background.\n- Students change only image_2.\n\nLimits: BACK and PROFILE views are invented by the model from one photo. Small faces, labels and ruler numbers can drift. Check every panel.\n\nPaid API node: one run per approval."
      ],
      "title": "READ ME",
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
